9share NEWS -- history of user-visible changes

* 0.1.0
  First release.  9share export / unexport (as a user), mount / unmount (root), rw / ro / off (as the user), status, wsl-boot;
  the 9share service (9share boot) starts at boot, keeps each tunnel up and each mount right.  The 9P server is daud, a fork of
  diod made for this package.  Configuration is 9share.conf(5), in obconf.
